WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:07.700
Kirari hikaru yume wo
taisetsu ni dakishimete,

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.170
~~ Keitaro ~~
Kirari hikaru yume wo
taisetsu ni dakishimete,

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:11.670
~~ Keitaro ~~
ippozutsu aruite ikou,
ashita e to.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.300
ippozutsu aruite ikou,
ashita e to.

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:24.780
Ah, irotoridori no machi ni,

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:30.980
ah, egao de aisatsu shite
hashiri dasu.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:38.820
Moshimo fukitsukeru
kaze ga tsumetakkutemo,

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:43.630
omoikkiri ketobashi
patto tobikoeruno.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:52.740
Kirari hikaru ima wo
taisetsu ni dakishimete,

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:57.150
subete ga
sutekina takaramono!

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:01.840
Kibou terasu taiyo...

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.850
...itsumademo kokoro ni,

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:12.030
ippozutsu aruite ikou,
ashita e to.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.470
Manager:
Keitaro Urashima

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.810
W-What's this all about?!

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:45.690
My, Keitaro's all grown up, buying
oh so exciting gifts like this for just us...!

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:47.870
All grown up?
Does that mean...?

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.730
Oh, so that's what it means?

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.890
Urashima, you dog!

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.870
No, you have it all wrong!

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:56.640
This is the stuff I got for you.
It's over here.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:58.270
Hey, where'd it go?

00:01:58.380 --> 00:01:59.670
Is this it? Or this?

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.850
Mr. Seta asked me to give
that underwear to Ms. Haruka.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:07.170
You've gotta believe me!
Won't you? Please?

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:09.850
Narusegawa...?

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.530
Huh? Where'd Narusegawa go?

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.160
So, what's this about
that idiot Seta?

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.190
Oh, right! He he told me
to give this to--

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:30.670
Mr. Urashima--!

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.270
Please, you must
stay strong, my big brother.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.610
Oh, are you a new resident?

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.350
I'm sorry for being so slow
to introduce myself.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.860
My name is Urashima.

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:49.420
What are you
talking about?

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.020
That's your younger
sister, <i>Kanako!</i>

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:53.520
Huh? Younger sister?

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.860
Ka-<i>Kanako?!</i>

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.510
Big brother...

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:12.410
K-Kanako... <i>Really?</i>
Why are you here?

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.280
It has been a long time.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.450
Well, you haven't seen each
other for quite a while.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:21.390
She's been traveling around with
grandma for a while, apparently.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:25.520
Yeah, that's right.
So, what are you doing now?

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:33.130
Well... While you were gone,
I tried to act as manager here...

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.710
Wow, hey, thanks.
Tough work, huh?

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:38.300
And I'm all grown up now.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:42.640
So could you fulfill that
promise you made...

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.740
Promise...?

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.510
Oh, <i>that</i> one?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.020
I promised I'd write you
letters, didn't I?

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:54.290
I'm sorry, I've been so busy studying,
I never got a chance to write any.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:58.090
<i>Hey!</i> Stop playing around
with your sister like that!

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.530
I'm not playing around
with my sister!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.830
You smell real nice, Keitaro!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.300
How'd things go over there?

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.830
Well, where can I begin...?

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.170
But don't worry, I got
presents for everybody.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.340
Later, okay?

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:19.980
Those aren't for you!

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:28.350
Boy, I don't know
what to do...

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:32.330
I still haven't decided
what I should say to him...

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:35.460
And is Kanako really...

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.830
I'm the promise girl.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.640
Then even if we went to Tokyo U
together, Keitaro wouldn't...

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:47.430
Oh, why did you have
to come back?!

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:50.450
That's a cruel thing to say to someone
who just walked in the door!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:51.850
Hup!

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:58.310
What's with all this stuff?.
Were you trying to block the hole?

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:01.680
Well, I thought that would be
better for Kanako.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:05.590
What that about? And aren't you
even a little bit happy I'm back?

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:08.190
N-No, not really. Same as always.
Yeah, it feels the same as always.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.960
O-Oh, okay...

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.600
Well, <i>I'm</i> happy, anyway.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.800
Huh?

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:20.600
You know, it gets lonely, w-when
you're not with someone you love.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:23.810
Keitaro...

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.010
What are you saying?

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:51.600
What do you think you're doing?!

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.670
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.910
I didn't even <i>do</i> anything yet!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.610
I <i>had</i> kinda missed the
old Naru Punch, though...

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.980
Um, Keitaro...

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:03.980
Huh?

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:06.920
Kanako was waiting for you
all this time, you know.

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:09.250
You should be nicer to her.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.460
Don't worry on my account.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.250
What's <i>that</i> supposed
to mean?!

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.700
Just forget it.
I'm going to bed now!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:17.460
Beat it!

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.490
Hey, wait!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:21.430
I don't know if you'd call it a <i>souvenir,</i>
exactly, but I want you to have this.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.300
It's some perverted lingerie, I bet.
I was listening!

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:25.810
No, you've got it all wrong!

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:36.720
Hey...!
C'mon, Narusegawa!

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:39.150
Why does it have
to be like this?

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:42.550
It's nice, having him do this...
I <i>ought</i> to be happy about it, but...

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:46.060
It seems like she isn't
very happy about things.

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:50.060
Big brother was much more wonderful
than I remembered...

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:53.790
So it wouldn't be a surprise if he had
a wonderful lover as well.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.340
I knew that.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:07:00.200
Even if we're not related by blood,
a younger sister is only a younger sister.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:03.810
He'll never see me as
anything more than that...

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.610
Maybe this was a battle
you couldn't win.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:14.080
Well, it <i>does</i> look like he's
forgotten about his promise...

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.930
Are you sure?

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:29.430
I don't want to be here if it means
being pitied by Ms. Naru.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.370
That would be too
wretched for words.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:40.950
Big brother!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.510
Come back here,
Urashima!

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.520
Wait! Just hold on, Motoko!

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:50.850
Rock Splitting Blade!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.660
You're good as ever, Motoko.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:58.000
Attack me like you mean it!
This is useless as practice!

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:00.930
Give me a break!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.040
Yeah! Go, go!

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.640
Hang in there, Keitaro!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.240
This is turning into
an interesting fight!

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:11.910
Get back here, Urashima!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.590
My eyes don't deceive me, Urashima.

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:23.680
Urashima, you've received training
from Mr. Seta, <i>haven't</i> you?

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.830
Only a little!

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.290
But you have
much to learn!

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.930
Motoko, what's this I hear about
you studying to get into Tokyo U?

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.540
I'm sorry!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.300
But Motoko, is that true?!
You're going to Tokyo U?

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.440
Haitani and Shirai
were talking about it.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:44.170
Oops! I'd better get going.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.150
I was in the
middle of something.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:47.580
Later.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.420
Those swine!

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.620
Motoko, you're going
for Tokyo U?

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:57.960
I-I just want to live up to the warrior ideal
of mastering both military <i>and</i> literary arts.

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:01.330
Uh, my decision has nothing
to do with Urashima as such...

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.920
Oh, <i>really?</i>

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:07.760
What's all this?

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.570
Oh, hey, Shinobu.
I hope you don't mind.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:14.740
It's your welcome home party, so why are
you doing the cooking, Mr. Urashima?

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:17.480
Of course, I'm not as
good as <i>you,</i> Shinobu.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.340
Besides, it's been so long, and I really
ought to start acting like the manager.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.080
What's all this?
It looks delicious.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.090
Keitaro, do you have--

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:29.520
Watermelons?
I already sliced one up.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:33.990
Delicious!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:43.040
Wow, check out Keitaro.
He's really got his act together!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.470
For a dropout.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:47.540
At any rate, he seems
to have grown a little.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.110
<i>I can't...</i>

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:55.540
<i>I'm the one that likes</i>
<i>big brother the most.</i>

00:09:56.120 --> 00:10:00.280
<i>It doesn't matter how you see him,</i>
<i>I like him more...</i>

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:06.050
<i>I can't...</i>
<i>I can't just give up on him.</i>

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:25.270
Isn't it a beautiful morning?

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.840
Okay!

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.450
Morning, Keitaro!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.630
What the hell
are you two doing?!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:44.200
Ms. Naru?
What are you doing?

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.330
Wha--? A b-blanket?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.800
I was just enjoying
big brother's scent.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.700
That's not healthy!

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:53.640
It's none of your concern.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:59.750
Um, what if you found someone more
special? Someone <i>other</i> than Keitaro?

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:01.410
I've made up my mind.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.510
I won't think of him
as my big brother.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.680
I'll look at him
simply as a man...

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:06.710
<i>Kanako!</i>

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.190
I won't be denied!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:12.200
I'm the promise girl.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:24.630
Then we'll have Ms. Shinobu and
Ms. Konno see to the shopping.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.700
Ms. Sara and Ms. Kaolla
will work on the boiler.

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:32.210
In light of recent reports of gropers in the
area, Ms. Motoko will patrol the grounds.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:36.080
And... Ms. Naru, the university
wanted you for something.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.850
Huh? I wonder
what they want?

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.620
Wow, just look at you getting
everything squared away...

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:44.830
My brother is still tired,
so I'd like all of you to pitch in.

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:46.090
- Okay!
- Sure!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.970
Hang 'em up,
hang 'em up...

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.910
The gang hasn't
changed one bit...!

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:59.470
Hang 'em, hang 'em...
Hangem sounds like a foreign name.

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:02.340
K-Kanako?

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:03.840
I-I'm sorry!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.510
Boy, that was a shocker...
Darn it, Kanako...

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:11.580
Huh? Normally, I'd be feeling the
Naru Punch right about now...

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:13.710
Ms. Naru isn't home right now.

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:15.920
Narusegawa?!

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:18.150
Again?!

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.920
Kanako?!

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.220
Why?!

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:23.730
Why isn't anyone home?!

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:27.400
We have Hinata Apartments
all to ourselves today, big brother.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.440
In any case, put some
clothes on, Kanako!

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:32.100
Why are you running,
big brother?

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.180
Uh, well, because...

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:35.680
<i>Crap...</i>

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:39.010
<i>Younger sister or no, if I'm left alone</i>
<i>with her dressed like that, I'd...</i>

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:42.120
<i>What am I, an animal?!</i>

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.960
K-Kanako, <i>why?!</i>

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:55.900
I <i>thought</i> this was fishy...

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:56.030
Off Limits

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.570
Off Limits
What the heck is going on?!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:59.560
Stay Out

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:02.860
Keitaro!

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.030
Kanako!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.970
Where <i>is</i> everyone?!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.550
I have no idea.
Taming chores, possibly.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.270
Taming?

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:14.850
<i>Taming, not Tama-ing!</i>

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.050
Big brother...

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.050
<i>If she keeps coming on</i>
<i>to me like this...</i>

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.620
<i>I... I might...</i>

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:27.790
Narusegawa! Thank God!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.630
Thank God for what?!

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:34.730
Look, Kanako...

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:50.950
Oh, brother.
That Kanako...

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.020
She was the little girl that
hung around me all the time...

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:57.420
But she sure has filled out
here and there...!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.190
What am I thinking?!

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.360
She's like a sister to me!

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.330
I've got Narusegawa as my...

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:07.960
Big brother.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:14.570
No, I didn't mean--

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:17.250
What is it, big brother?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.540
No, no, it's nothing!
Nothing at all!

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:29.520
<i>S-Something's pressing against me...</i>
<i>Something big and soft...</i>

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.160
<i>Did Kanako have</i>
<i>breasts this big...?</i>

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:40.270
What are you doing, Ms. Naru?!

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:43.610
Oops! I mistook this
for a water slide!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.710
I doubt that!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.940
Oh, you've got something
stuck to you, Kanako

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.380
A-A makeup prosthetic!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.250
Kanako, you kidder!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:56.110
My appearance is none
of your concern!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.990
Why do you insist on interfering
with me and my brother?!

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:03.420
Or are you saying that you have
some special relationship with him?!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.670
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:20.800
Just your normal relationship between
a manager and a tenant, of course.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.950
That's all?

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:25.650
Keitaro?!

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:27.450
Big brother!

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.450
This is all <i>your</i> fault,
Ms. Naru!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.110
Why is it <i>my</i> fault?!

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:37.920
Why...?

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.460
You just can't manage to be
all alone with my brother, huh?

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:48.240
You may <i>say</i> that,
Ms. Naru,

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.800
but what you say and what you <i>do</i>
are as different as night and day!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:54.640
If you don't stop him,
he'll just keep--

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.170
Excuse me...

00:15:56.910 --> 00:16:01.410
I came across this odd watermelon.
Kanako, would you care for some?

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.210
Ms. Mutsumi...

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:06.590
Yes?

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.600
<i>I'm such an idiot, idiot, idiot...</i>

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.960
<i>Why can't I be less stubborn</i>
<i>in front of Keitaro...?</i>

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:20.240
<i>Is it because Kanako is the girl</i>
<i>he made the promise to?</i>

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:21.830
<i>Is it just because of that...?</i>

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.110
What are you doing, Naru?

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:28.540
Oh, get lost. I was just wallowing
in some self-loathing that's all.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:29.900
Wha--?

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.440
""Naru""? Does that mean--

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.410
What the hell are you
doing in here?!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:38.690
Naru, I have something
important to tell you.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:40.160
S-Stay away from me!

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:42.560
No, no!
A-A little farther away than that!

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.550
Narusegawa sure seems to be
having a ball down there...

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.960
If this keeps up, how long is it
gonna be before I can give her--

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:56.630
D-Don't tell me she's avoiding me
because she's fallen for another guy?

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:00.630
Excuse me, Mr. Urashima.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.450
""Excuse me?""
""Mr. Urashima?""

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.270
What the--?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:13.290
S-Sorry, did I get into the wrong bath
by mistake again?! No, this is the right one.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:16.390
Hey, I thought you
were down there.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:17.730
No.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:23.670
I was thinking, we haven't had a chance
to have a good talk since you got back...

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.530
...so I thought I'd wash
your back for you.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.000
Huh? But that's--

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.600
My fantasies haven't come back
with a vengeance, have they?

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.670
Don't be a baby!
Come out of there!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.080
Narusegawa, this is a bad idea!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.770
I'm thankful,
but it's a bad idea!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.850
Wh-What are you doing?
Get out, I said...!

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:43.650
C'mon, don't be angry, Naru.

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:45.890
I love you.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.250
Wha--?!

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:52.990
Wh-What do you
think you're doing?!

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:56.600
Naru, I was thinking about you
the whole time I was in America.

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:00.570
Naru, will you tell me?

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.140
How do you feel about me?

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.400
No, I can't...

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:07.110
Or do you...

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.250
Or do I <i>what?</i>

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:14.550
Or do you like your little sister more?
Kanako, I mean.

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:17.080
Is that it?

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:18.580
Then I'll just...

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:22.560
What is this nonsense you're spouting?
Kanako's my <i>sister,</i> you know?!

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.390
Like I said at the airport,
I still feel...

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.330
K-<i>Kanako?!</i>

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.360
Big brother...

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.500
I need to ask you a favor...

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:43.270
Tell me, Naru...
How do you feel?

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:48.940
Oh, dear.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.450
Oh, dear!

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:54.650
Ms. Mutsumi!

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:56.580
Hey, what's up?

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.220
Whoa, she's naked!

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:06.990
Kanako said Ms. Naru and Keitaro's
relationship was taking forever to develop...

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.530
So we thought we'd
prod it along a little...

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.400
<i>What's she up to?!</i>

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.900
<i>What are you doing with Keitaro while</i>
<i>you've kept me occupied like this...?</i>

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:18.040
Keitaro! Kanako!
What are you two--

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.050
Keitaro?!

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.320
Huh? What's up, guys?

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:35.620
Oh dear, that must feel nice.

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:37.960
Aw, man... She's just
<i>shampooing</i> him.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:41.370
Big brother... Are there any
spots that are itchy?

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.200
Hm? Nope...

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:47.070
Say, being like this brings
back memories, doesn't it?

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:48.840
Hm? Of what?

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:54.840
Remem...ber...

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:58.540
Huh? Kanako?

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:09.330
Kanako... Why?

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:12.860
Kanako? What am I
supposed to do with this?

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.830
Put it away!

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:33.390
Really? So there haven't
been any developments?

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:36.290
Developments?
More like <i>regression.</i>

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:40.560
These days, it seems like it's
Ms. Naru that's avoiding Urashima.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.390
I wonder what's
wrong with Naru?

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:45.070
Kanako is Mr. Urashima's
younger sister, right?

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.900
It's only natural that the two
of them would be pretty close.

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:51.640
I knew it, we should've run her and
her monster cat out of the building.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:54.110
I wanna research
that monster cat!

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.780
Do you really think
it's just that?

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:57.510
Huh?

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:00.950
Ms. Naru has had her heart
made up for a long time.

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.350
I don't think that would change
just because Ms. Kanako is here.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:05.850
So why is she...?

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:09.060
That's true. If Ms. Naru would
just come out and say it,

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:11.530
we would all be spared
a great deal of grief.

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.860
""We""?

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.700
Well, uh...

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:17.370
Mr. Urashima is partly
to blame, too.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:22.440
As long as he's up-front about his feelings,
it shouldn't matter <i>how</i> Naru acts.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:24.670
Yeah, but this is our dropout
that we're talking about...

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:28.240
N-No, that can't be the reason...
I don't think so, anyway...

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:39.720
Hey!

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:40.950
Oh. Hey.

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:43.150
Here you go.
This is all you need?

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.050
I appreciate it.

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.430
Finally going to do it, huh?

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:47.900
D-Do what?

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:50.090
You're gonna give her
what's in here, right?

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:52.860
Um, uh, well...

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:56.730
Girls may say different,
but they're suckers for formality.

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.740
But what am I gonna do
if she turns me down...?

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:01.400
Can't you come with me?

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:02.270
You idiot!

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:06.610
If Haruka finds out I nabbed that for you,
<i>I'm</i> the one she's gonna beat to death!

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:10.110
You can do it.

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:11.650
Right...

00:22:13.190 --> 00:22:15.560
Annex Key
Not to Leave Premises

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:18.360
Really?

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.020
Can't I at least stay here
for one night?

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.790
The fall semester's already
started for you, right?

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:25.260
I'll be fine.

00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:28.930
Okay... But you can call
me anytime, okay, Naru?

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:40.840
<i>Come to think of it, you could say</i>
<i>it was thanks to Keitaro...</i>

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:43.410
<i>...that Mei and I have</i>
<i>gotten to be so close.</i>

00:22:46.560 --> 00:22:49.860
<i>Maybe it's my turn to try</i>
<i>to do something for</i> him.

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:53.620
Keitaro?

00:23:00.170 --> 00:23:04.160
Meet me at the abandoned annex
on the mountainside tonight. --K

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:31.970
Hm?

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:38.200
Oh, this place isn't used anymore,
but it used to be called the Cupid Inn.

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:42.210
It's a miraculous place where
couples who profess their love here...

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:42.780
Keep Out

00:23:42.780 --> 00:23:44.940
Keep Out
...are bound together,
and if they stay the night,

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:47.410
they'll live happily
ever after.

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:58.690
If I profess my love
to Narusegawa here...

00:23:59.800 --> 00:24:01.590
And then I know we'll...

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:06.830
Well, it's not like we'll go
all the way or anything!

00:24:14.040 --> 00:24:15.240
H-Here she comes!

00:24:19.220 --> 00:24:20.200
Really?

00:24:20.580 --> 00:24:23.020
Urashima didn't ask you
to go anywhere?

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:25.320
Boy, you're persistent.

00:24:25.890 --> 00:24:27.220
<i>It's for the best.</i>

00:24:27.260 --> 00:24:31.220
<i>Unless I set things up, those two will</i>
<i>never sit down and talk to one another.</i>

00:24:31.690 --> 00:24:32.920
Take a look.

00:24:33.260 --> 00:24:34.560
What're these?

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:37.620
Oh. They're guest registries
from the annex.

00:24:38.070 --> 00:24:39.830
You're interested
in this stuff?.

00:24:39.870 --> 00:24:43.930
Yeah, a little.
So, what kind of a place is it?

00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:46.130
I suppose you could call it
a sort of magical hot spot.

00:24:46.440 --> 00:24:48.140
- M-Magical hot spot?!
- M-Magical hot spot?!

00:24:48.440 --> 00:24:50.470
From time immemorial,
thousands of couples have...

00:24:50.510 --> 00:24:53.680
...ended up in long, happy relationships
thanks to the power of that annex.

00:24:53.920 --> 00:24:57.110
If two men stay the night together,
the power works on them, too,

00:24:57.150 --> 00:24:59.520
and it was naturally used for
politically motivated marriages.

00:24:59.560 --> 00:25:03.050
So two generations ago, it was sealed
up to keep it from being used.

00:25:03.960 --> 00:25:07.290
T-That's all just legend, right?

00:25:08.670 --> 00:25:10.830
I'm not so sure.

00:25:11.100 --> 00:25:16.000
Well, the keys to the place are kept
here, so it couldn't be easily...

00:25:16.110 --> 00:25:18.160
Huh? The keys!

00:25:19.280 --> 00:25:21.740
Keitaro... Don't tell me
you were going to--

00:25:22.150 --> 00:25:24.380
Huh? What is it, Naru?

00:25:32.860 --> 00:25:36.020
Thank you for coming.

00:25:37.490 --> 00:25:41.260
I've been in love with you
for a long, long time.

00:25:42.370 --> 00:25:43.830
Really...?

00:25:43.870 --> 00:25:48.000
I'm sorry about all the promises
I made when I was a kid,

00:25:48.040 --> 00:25:51.230
but it's the promise I made with
<i>you</i> that means the most to me.

00:25:52.640 --> 00:25:55.670
I... I want to make good on
that promise I made with you!

00:25:55.710 --> 00:25:58.240
So I want to... ask you to...

00:26:00.480 --> 00:26:02.010
<i>Y-Yes!</i>

00:26:02.620 --> 00:26:06.280
Um, th-this is for you,
Narusegawa...

00:26:06.320 --> 00:26:07.350
Big brother...

00:26:13.500 --> 00:26:14.520
Kanako!

00:26:14.730 --> 00:26:17.130
I'm sorry, that letter
was actually for me!

00:26:51.030 --> 00:26:52.520
Keitaro!

00:26:52.840 --> 00:26:53.960
Narusegawa!

00:26:55.340 --> 00:26:57.830
You're too late,
Ms. Naru.

00:26:58.210 --> 00:27:00.270
Big brother has made
his feelings clear.

00:27:00.740 --> 00:27:04.610
He has lived up to the
promise he made to me.

00:27:05.320 --> 00:27:07.610
This is the proof.

00:27:11.390 --> 00:27:13.550
No! Kanako, that's for--

00:27:18.230 --> 00:27:20.660
Keitaro... This is a--

00:27:20.830 --> 00:27:22.730
Narusegawa, that's--

00:27:22.770 --> 00:27:23.960
Big brother!

00:27:24.300 --> 00:27:27.030
That's for you.

00:27:36.050 --> 00:27:37.100
Ow!

00:27:45.190 --> 00:27:47.620
I've won.

00:27:55.230 --> 00:28:00.190
Karakara kawaiteiru mune no naka.
Inside of me is dry, bone dry.

00:28:00.240 --> 00:28:05.900
Futo tachidomari ki ga tsuita kara
I came to a stop and suddenly realized it.

00:28:06.040 --> 00:28:11.070
Daremoga isoideiru machi no naka
In this city where everyone is rushing about,

00:28:11.110 --> 00:28:16.110
Sukoshi yukkuri aruite mita
I tried walking a little more slowly.

00:28:16.150 --> 00:28:22.150
Koe ni dasanai negai,
When there's a wish I can't voice,

00:28:22.460 --> 00:28:31.470
me wo tojite kou omouno, ""Try!""
I close my eyes and say to myself, ""Try!""

00:28:31.470 --> 00:28:37.170
Dakedo anata ga iru, ai wo motomete iru.
But you're here, you're longing for love.

00:28:37.440 --> 00:28:40.100
Futari nara,
With the two of us,

00:28:40.140 --> 00:28:44.940
yasashii namida ni kawaru,
I'm sure it will turn into tears of kindness,

00:28:46.020 --> 00:28:50.820
yume wa kitto kanau.
and our dreams will come true.
